standalone motion product. It is not relicensed under Cairnfold's MIT/Apache
licenses. scripts/wave.gd converts the ASF/AMC recording into head-relative hand
aim transforms at its original 120 Hz for game/animations/wave.tres. It authors
no rotations or keyframes; the avatar uses the same hand targets as VR tracking.

